@startuml
title Optional diagnostics: native supervision and independent final check
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam activityBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ArrowColor #475569

start
:Gradle prepareTaskDiagnostics / Maven prepare-diagnostics\nPrivate expected settings; no tests or Docker access;
:External JDK DiagnosticsCli run\nFresh single-use session;
if (Dedicated Docker checks enabled?) then (yes)
  :Read daemon identity and ps --all\nInitial daemon must be empty;
  if (Initial check passed?) then (yes)
  else (no)
    :Do not start native build\nRetain failed initial evidence;
    stop
  endif
endif
:Supervise native Gradle / Maven command\nFlush bounded process / job / DinD / host samples;
if (Runner survives?) then (yes)
  :Record native exit / timeout / interruption\nBest-effort stop of owned processes on timeout;
else (killed)
  :Partial samples may survive\nMissing final process result is incomplete;
endif
:Independent finish / adapter verification\nAlso callable from CI after_script;
:Recheck identity, process result and samples\nRead-only final ps --all on the same dedicated daemon;
:Write matching HTML then JSON\nMissing evidence, failure or leftovers cannot pass;
note right
  No container creation or deletion.
  Unknown memory is not zero.
  Exit 137 alone is not proof of OOM.
  Preserve native and C2 gates.
end note
stop
@enduml
